Read `spec-manifest.yaml`, governance, ship-system, `production-rules.md`, target `design.md`, material card, and `integration.yaml` in that order.

The active workflow is component-first: full-effect concept, component breakdown, per-component production/reuse, Blender assembly, UE5. Never load retired whole-ship line/multiview/blockout artifacts as current inputs.

For `ShipType_SmallSailer01`, current validation is Hull plus a simple separate scalable Deck. Hull must not contain gunports or attachments. Gunports are later independent logical modules.
